  "Headline land/expand category used in executive reporting. One of: Auto Provisioned, Bundle, Existing-Customer New Collection, Existing-Customer New Site Expand, Land, Non-Customer New Site Expand, Same Site Expand, Unknown."
  expandTypeTier1: String
  "Coarser grouping of the expansion motion, parallel to tier 1 (not nested in it). One of: Bundle, Cross-flow, Land, New Site Expand, Unknown."
  expandTypeTier2: String
}

