  The relative URL base path for this help center, derived from its status and slug.
  - /helpcenter/<slug> when ACTIVE with a slug
  - /helpcenter/test/<slug> when SANDBOX with a slug
  - /servicedesk/customer when ACTIVE without a slug (default HC)
  - /servicedesk/customer/test when SANDBOX without a slug (default HC)
  """
  basePath: String
  "Whether the help center has any unpublished draft changes."
  hasUnpublishedChanges: Boolean
  "Branding associated with the Help Center (would be null for Basic)"
