"""
A consolidated type containing pre-fetched field values for an issue on the backlog view.
This type exists to reduce GraphQL thread management overhead by consolidating many individual
field data fetchers into a single data fetcher that batch-loads all required field values at once.

Instead of a separate data fetcher per field, this type resolves all field values in a single data fetcher for an issue,
significantly reducing thread overhead when loading hundreds or thousands of issues on the backlog.
"""
