  To query this field a client will need to add the '@optIn(to: "JiraSprintStatusClassification")' query directive to the 'sprintStatusClassifications' field, or to any of its parents.
  
  The field is extremely unstable. It can go through changes at any moment, and its execution can be slow and/or unreliable. Clients should use it with care and at their own risk!
  """
  sprintStatusClassifications: JiraSprintStatusClassifications @lifecycle(allowThirdParties : false, name : "JiraSprintStatusClassification", stage : EXPERIMENTAL)
  """
  P85 of total completed time per issue/status for the board's historical baseline.
  Returns up to 50 in-progress statuses ordered by duration descending, then status ID.
