  |:--------------------------|:-------------|
  | SESSION | ✅ Yes |
  | API_TOKEN | ✅ Yes |
  | CONTAINER_TOKEN | ❌ No |
  | FIRST_PARTY_OAUTH | ✅ Yes |
  | THIRD_PARTY_OAUTH | ✅ Yes |
  | UNAUTHENTICATED | ✅ Yes |
  """
  thresholdValue: Long
