  This field is in the 'EXPERIMENTAL' lifecycle stage
  
  To query this field a client will need to add the '@optIn(to: "JiraFieldSchemeRequiredOnIssueTypes")' query directive to the 'requiredOnIssueTypes' field, or to any of its parents.
  
