  Returns the persisted filter field preferences for the current user in the current scope as used by the filter panel.
  
  The scope is resolved on the server based on the current context (for example, project or board).
  For space views, this effectively behaves as "per user + per space": all views within
  the same space that use the filter panel share the same configuration.
  
  Internally, for a space scope, the configuration is stored via the view config framework using a Jira
  view ARI as the scope. The ARI has the following shape, with a dedicated suffix for the filter panel:
  
  ari:cloud:jira:{siteId}:view/activation/{activationId}/project/{projectId}/view_filter_panel
  
  Example for a specific project:
  ari:cloud:jira:a436116f-02ce-4520-8fbb-7301462a1674:view/activation/707f5012-e438-4ebc-a488-989b59dfbfb6/project/10000/view_filter_panel
  
