  """
  Sets persisted field preferences for the current user within a scope context.
  Persists ordered field JQL terms the user selected in filter refinement panel.
  
  For space views, this effectively behaves as "per user + per space": all views within
  the same space that use the filter panel share the same configuration.
  
  The persisted field preferences can be retrieved via the `myFilterFields` query,
  which returns the same ordered list of field JQL terms.
  
  If no preferences are stored for the scope, the `myFilterFields` query returns
  a default set of fields.
  
  Backend validates each field exists and drops invalid ones, returning only successfully persisted fields.
  
