  errors: [MutationError!]
  field: JiraNumberField
  success: Boolean!
  """
  Connection of issue fields that were updated as a result of the mutation.
  Since this is a mutation payload, only the `first` pagination argument is supported to limit results - if `pageInfo.hasNext`
  is true in the response payload, it is recommended to refetch all fields on the updated issue to ensure stale issue field values
  are not being used.
  
  ### Field lifecycle
  
