  | FIRST_PARTY_OAUTH | ✅ Yes |
  | THIRD_PARTY_OAUTH | ✅ Yes |
  | UNAUTHENTICATED | ✅ Yes |
  """
  schemesOverLimit: Int
  """
  Count of workflow schemes whose workflow count is reaching the workflows limit (>= 0.75 * specified limit)
  
  |Authentication Category    |Callable      |
  |:--------------------------|:-------------|
  | SESSION | ✅ Yes |
  | API_TOKEN | ✅ Yes |
  | CONTAINER_TOKEN | ❌ No |
