  One of the following scopes will need to be present on OAuth requests to get data from this field
  
  * __read:jira-work__
  """
  onInsightCreated(projectAri: ID! @ARI(interpreted : false, owner : "jira/jira-product-discovery", type : "project", usesActivationId : false)): PolarisInsight @rateLimit(cost : 100, currency : POLARIS_INSIGHTS_QUERY_CURRENCY) @scopes(product : JIRA, required : [READ_JIRA_WORK])
  """
  
  
  |Authentication Category    |Callable      |
  |:--------------------------|:-------------|
  | SESSION | ✅ Yes |
  | API_TOKEN | ✅ Yes |
  | CONTAINER_TOKEN | ❌ No |
  | FIRST_PARTY_OAUTH | ❌ No |
  | THIRD_PARTY_OAUTH | ✅ Yes |
  | UNAUTHENTICATED | ❌ No |
