  Whether this plan was generated from similar past plans. Null/absent for legacy plans or older producers;
  consumers should treat absence as false.
  """
  generatedFromSimilarPlans: Boolean
  """
  Whether this plan can be regenerated using the latest KB/runbook context.
  True when: plan is in PENDING state AND tenant has the regenerate plan feature enabled.
  Used by the UI to show or hide the 'Regenerate plan with latest knowledge' button.
  Will automatically become false once execution starts (plan leaves PENDING state).
  """
