  The field is extremely unstable. It can go through changes at any moment, and its execution can be slow and/or unreliable. Clients should use it with care and at their own risk!
  """
  applyAppPublishWizardValidationAction(appSoftwareId: ID!, fieldId: ID!, input: MarketplaceConsoleAppPublishWizardValidationActionInput!, submissionId: ID!): MarketplaceConsoleAppPublishWizardSessionResult @lifecycle(allowThirdParties : false, name : "MarketplaceConsoleApplyAppPublishWizardValidationAction", stage : EXPERIMENTAL) @rateLimited(disabled : false, rate : 25, usePerIpPolicy : false, usePerUserPolicy : true)
